    <h1>Metal Recycling</h1>

    <img src="file:///C:/Users/Administrator/Downloads/Metal.jpg" width="300">

    <h2>What is Metal Recycling?</h2>

    <p>
        Metal recycling is the process of collecting
        used metals and turning them into new products.
        It helps reduce waste and save resources.
    </p>

    <h2>Benefits of Metal Recycling</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>Reduces metal waste.</li>
        <li>Saves natural resources.</li>
        <li>Saves energy.</li>
        <li>Helps reduce pollution.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Examples of Recyclable Metals</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>Aluminum cans</li>
        <li>Steel cans</li>
        <li>Old metal containers</li>
        <li>Scrap metal</li>
    </ul>

