    <h1>Paper Recycling</h1>
 
    <img src="file:///C:/Users/Administrator/Downloads/Plastic.jpg" width="300">

    <h2>What is Paper Recycling?</h2>

    <p>
        Paper recycling is the process of collecting
        used paper and turning it into new paper products.
        It helps reduce waste and save trees.
    </p>

    <h2>Benefits of Paper Recycling</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>Helps save trees.</li>
        <li>Reduces paper waste.</li>
        <li>Saves natural resources.</li>
        <li>Keeps the environment clean.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Examples of Recyclable Paper</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>Old newspapers</li>
        <li>Used notebooks</li>
        <li>Cardboard boxes</li>
        <li>Paper bags</li>
    </ul>

